# agentbox settings. Copy to ~/.config/agentbox/config.env and adjust:
#   mkdir -p ~/.config/agentbox && cp config.env.example ~/.config/agentbox/config.env
# Format: KEY=VALUE, one per line, # starts a comment, quotes are optional.
# The file is parsed, not executed. Environment variables override it.

# MCP servers: modules from mcp/ (shared) or ~/.config/agentbox/mcp.local/
# (yours), see README
# "MCP servers". context7 is always on. Each module may need settings below
# and Podman secrets (README, step 5).
#AB_MCP=grafana graylog github

# Settings of the grafana and graylog modules: base URLs, without /api or /mcp.
#GRAFANA_URL=https://grafana.example.internal
#GRAYLOG_URL=https://graylog.example.internal

# Hosts the agent may reach: groups from egress.d/ (shared) or egress.local.d/
# (yours), see README "Egress". Unset: anthropic openai pypi go. A list
# replaces that; Claude Code needs anthropic.
#AB_EGRESS=anthropic openai pypi go gcs

# Optional.
# Setting of the github module.
#GH_TOOLSETS=context,repos,issues,pull_requests,actions
# Skill sources: skills.d/ (shared) or skills.local.d/ (yours), see README
# "Skills". Installed into the skills directory on the next start.
#AB_SKILLS=mattpocock
#AB_SKILLS_DIR=/path/to/skills
# Seconds between agent updates and between update checks (images, skills).
#AB_UPDATE_EVERY=21600
# 0: no check for newer sidecar images and vendored skills before a session.
#AB_CHECK_UPDATES=1
# graphify extras baked into the image, e.g. [terraform] for .tf/.hcl or
# [sql,terraform]; takes effect on the next build: AB_UPGRADE=1 ./run.sh
#AB_GRAPHIFY_EXTRAS=[terraform]
# Tool versions baked into the image (default: see Containerfile); take effect
# on the next build: AB_UPGRADE=1 ./run.sh. Go: "1.26" = latest 1.26.x,
# "1.26.3" exact, empty = latest; golangci-lint: exact or empty = latest.
#AB_PYTHON_VERSIONS=3.12 3.13 3.14
#AB_GO_VERSION=1.26
#AB_GOLANGCI_LINT_VERSION=
# Your dev containers the agent may reach by name (redis:6379), see README.
#AB_SERVICES=redis rabbitmq postgres
# Services outside the box (test databases, queues) the agent may reach by
# name, here as db:5432; also per repo in env/<repo dir name>.conf. See
# README "Test servers".
#AB_FORWARD=db=db.test.example:5432 mq=mq.test.example:5672
# Per-project environment files, <repo dir name>.env, see README.
#AB_ENV_DIR=/path/to/env
